# fixture: list.md
# Shift-Return at the end of a list item breaks the line inside the item: the
# new line is indented to the item's text, with no marker. Driven as a real
# key event, since the editor catches it in keyDown.
caretend
shiftenter
type more
assertsource beta
assertsource   more
assertnot - more
# Return on the continuation line starts the next item, not a bare line.
enter
type next
assertsource - next
assertinvariants
done
